sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Owner
  participant C as Control plane
  participant G as Egress<br/>Proxy
  participant R as Cleanup /<br/>credential owner
  O->>C: Withdraw source access or stop revision
  C-->>O: Withdrawal committed
  G->>C: Admit next operation
  C-->>G: Deny or unavailable
  Note over C,G: New unauthorized work is blocked
  Note over G,R: Admitted finite work may finish<br/>by its original deadline
  C-->>O: Status and outstanding cleanup
  C->>R: Retain unresolved cleanup obligations
  Note over C,R: Original owner retains uncertain effects
  R-->>C: Evidence of resolved or pending work
  Note over C,R: Local closure does not prove provider disposal
